sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Price API command
    participant W as Usage worker
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    Note over P,D: Row selector: customer_billing_state.customer_id = C<br/>Event row: usage_inbox.source = S and usage_inbox.event_id = E<br/>Request advisory identity: api_idempotency_operations.operation_scope<br/>plus api_idempotency_operations.idempotency_key (not a row lock)<br/>Catalog advisory (65102, 2): protects price_versions, not a column
    alt New price gets the catalog first
        P->>D: BEGIN, scoped request lock, no stored result
        P->>D: Exclusive catalog advisory lock
        W->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        W->>D: Shared catalog advisory lock
        Note over W,D: WAIT for the exclusive catalog owner
        P->>D: Sample UTC day after locking<br/>Validate activation and preserve rated history
        P->>D: Insert price and request result, COMMIT
        D-->>W: Shared catalog lock granted
        W->>D: FOR UPDATE<br/>usage_inbox.source = S<br/>usage_inbox.event_id = E, read committed price_versions
        W->>D: Rate at consumption time and COMMIT
    else Worker gets the shared catalog first
        W->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C, shared catalog lock
        P->>D: BEGIN, scoped request lock<br/>Request exclusive catalog lock
        Note over P,D: WAIT for all shared catalog holders
        W->>D: FOR UPDATE<br/>usage_inbox.source = S<br/>usage_inbox.event_id = E, rate and COMMIT
        D-->>P: Exclusive catalog lock granted
        P->>D: Sample UTC day, recheck affected rated usage_inbox rows
        alt Proposed price preserves rated history
            P->>D: Insert price and request result, COMMIT
        else Price changes a selected version or valid interval
            P->>D: ROLLBACK, return 409 billing_conflict
        end
    end
    Note over P,D: An activation that became backdated while waiting returns 422.<br/>Ordinary price creation does not take an account lock.<br/>The catalog lock is global within this database.
